<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-30T16:06:18.086Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:06:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese coast guard and navy ships gathered near Scarborough Shoal and Panatag Shoal while the carrier Liaoning entered the western Pacific with 17 accompanying vessels, prompting alarms in Japan, Taiwan and the Philippines. The Philippine Coast Guard delivered fuel to Filipino fishermen at Scarborough Shoal as it monitored the Chinese presence, and China warned the Philippines to cease provocations and false claims. Australian defence officials said China’s military build-up is creating pressure in the region, and tensions flared again at an ASEAN defence gathering. A ferry listing off Quezon Province was rescued, with 58 passengers saved. The conflict recorded 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNelRKZ21DWjJBX09xRTJyZnBicWsyLWJTQk1CcmVoVFJYLXBIcWt6LWpwdDRyeGhzbFpNaUFmV0ZhM0NuWmNVRXpKd2s2QnY3bTdwTUFJSFBoUEVUNjlWbThFLXpxN0dkRklMYy1JQVZhWW5abUNtQlZYc21la2htWWVzUWVBMjhTMHc5OF80V3EzLWVPQmFhZnFyOExtWEVfeFhsMnVOYzdfakc1NHdIMjN3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Free Malaysia Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Baird Maritime&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxONzNfb0hlLVRjNWl6aXd5MnR0U0N0ZFZvMUhQd3FIa1pKR2JJUDlNV25DZGo3WHEtRjhMdnFaZU1TODE1LVRERXJRM1IzbWxnc2hlRURncHpkcWhNYW1xMDR0cVBialpiaEI5WFhhLXVmUldvVmtCNTdnQ3Z4ekxiLUMwcGk2U2c1M3RDWjBwSnhxSG1EeURIUV9hUDNIbFRxeUpRVGx4SnhRdkNhM0xvTXlSNl9sYjZLNnVxMnZ0b3p6UWUtLWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTE9qeGFtck1GTWJwTldYUFEzNUk2cmxs